--- !u!114 &1875309245
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1875309244}
  m_Enabled: 0
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 870965030168bfa4988a1f48e2415150, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speed: 0.25
  dialogue:
    name: Narrator
    sentences:
    - Do you see this young boy?
    - This boy's name is NAME...
    - NAME feels lost, sad and confused...
    - He wandered through bustling places in far distant countries, the aromas of
      spices and exotic foods mingling with the hum of languages he couldn't quite
      understand...
    - His eyes, wide with wonder, absorbed the vibrant colors of local crafts and
      the intricate details of ancient architecture that whispered stories of ages
      past...
    - Through sun-soaked beaches and misty mountain villages, NAME embraced the diversity
      of the world around him, making fleeting connections with those he encountered
      along the way...
    - But amid the mesmerizing landscapes and connections, a sense of loneliness
      lingered within NAME...
    - 'He felt like a puzzle piece adrift in the wind, searching for its place in
      a larger picture... '
    - The world unfurled its beauty before NAME's eyes, from the towering skyscrapers
      that scraped the heavens to the untamed wildernesses that whispered secrets
      to those who listened...
    - But, as he stood on the edge of a cruise ship and gazed out at the horizon
      that seemed to stretch to infinity, a quiet ache tugged at his heart...
    - Nothing seemed to make him happy and he still felt empty...
    - Suddenly as he was sitting on a cruise ship travelling to who knows where an
      unpleasent sound was heard that brought confusion to everyone...
    - Out of nowhere the ship started sinking...
    - Every passenger on the ship started panicking and all of a sudden from a quiet
      and chill afternoon it turned to a chaotic and scary nightmare that scared
      the crap out of NAME...
    - Amidst all of this chaos NAME forgot all of his loneliness and sadness and
      he jumped in the water to try to save his life...
